{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Seconds-Long Speedrunning game about short levels and fast gameplay. The average level only takes a couple seconds to finish, so you can replay and hone your skills to earn higher medal ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play through the levels, you can collet medals, up to S-Rank, to help you unlock more levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It takes only a couple seconds to beat a level, but that doesn't mean all of them are easy.\u00a0 Some contain precision elements to quickly traverse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because of the short levels, You can quickly replay levels to get a better time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Planned to be included in full game</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45 Handcrafted levels (Split between 9 worlds)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Longer gauntlet levels to test your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versus mode to compete against your friends head-on</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4014700?t=1757603828","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014700/c4c506bf51fe674686f17c415fc9abb8dc701adc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757603828","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014700/14d4ab6dbe93502358e554dbdfbc2c75c7b527e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757603828","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014700/14d4ab6dbe93502358e554dbdfbc2c75c7b527e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757603828","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Seconds-Long Speedrunning game about short levels and fast gameplay. The average level only takes a couple seconds to finish, so you can replay and hone your skills to earn higher medal ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you play through the levels, you can collet medals, up to S-Rank, to help you unlock more levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It takes only a couple seconds to beat a level, but that doesn't mean all of them are easy.\u00a0 Some contain precision elements to quickly traverse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because of the short levels, You can quickly replay levels to get a better time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Planned to be included in full game</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45 Handcrafted levels (Split between 9 worlds)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Longer gauntlet levels to test your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Versus mode to compete against your friends head-on</p></li></ul>","developers":["CatAttack Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014700/e76640e85bc72decc5ca2eb5200902c08e85b9ad/header.jpg?t=1757603828","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Micro Rush","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["CatAttack Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":